% ---------------------------------------------------------------- braids / Garside

% EMS Tracts in Mathematics 22.  Cited in def:braid for two things, both
% confirmed: Lem. IX.1.22, that the positive lift of a permutation is well
% defined and injective (this is what the proofs actually use), and
% Prop. IX.1.35, that the resulting relations present B_N^+ (the germ
% presentation, quoted as context only).  Locators are numbered results, so
% they are stable across the 2014 manuscript and the published edition.
@book{Garsidebook,
